Done. All writes under `ros2_stack/` only, grounded in `09_platform` + `02-ros2-migration.md`:

- `ros2_stack/docker/Dockerfile.humble` — `ros:humble-ros-base-jammy` (`linux/arm64`), installs `ros-humble-ros-base`, `nav2-bringup`, `control-toolbox`, `serial-driver` (+pyserial), `colcon`, `rosdep`; `foxglove-bridge` guarded with skip fallback. No `ros1_bridge` (separate from-source build per migration doc).
- `ros2_stack/docker/docker-compose.yml` — `privileged`, `network_mode: host`, `/dev` bind + explicit `devices` for ttyS9/ttyS1/ttyS4/ttyS3/ttyUSB0-2 (from `dev_nodes.txt`), `../src→/work/src` plus `launch/`, `config/`.
- `ros2_stack/scripts/build.sh` — `docker compose build` + `colcon build --symlink-install` in container, args pass through.
- `ros2_stack/scripts/run_stack.sh` — interactive shell or `ros2 launch <pkg> <launch.py>`, sources Humble + overlay.
- `ros2_stack/docs/deployment.md` — d-gap table (20.04.6 focal + 5.10.209 aarch64 + Noetic vs Humble-needs-22.04), stop-or-bridge coexistence rule, serial map with live baud rates, disk-space/Docker-missing prerequisites.

Verified: `bash -n` on both scripts, compose YAML parses, scripts executable.
